        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Possibly a seat or cushion cover. A yellow basket supporting a large naturalistic floral bunch including roses and chrysanthemums. Polychrome silk yarns in tent stitch entirely covering a white cotton canvas. Stained in upper left hand corner; slightly worn. See: 43. 1020."@en ;
